  "description": {
   "en": "Yano Tobari is a transfer student who arrives out of season. She seems like an extraordinary celebrity, so everyone avoids her. Hiruma, who was ordered by the teacher to look after her, is the only one who becomes friends with her. Actually, before he even wanted to, it happened. And so Hiruma ends up being hit by constant misfortune, but this is because Tobari took Hiruma's place in order to escape from a monster named Erlik...\n\n「アンディヌ」\n「裸の女王様」\n「古い記憶のホラーストーリー」\n「５円玉にぎって」\n「こわい夢」\n「おばあちゃんのこわい話」\n「真昼のルヴナン」\n「輪廻」\n「迷い道」\n「登校拒否の道」\n「ふす」"
